<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Accumulate Bangchak - Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Accumulate Bangchak - Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Co said on Wednesday that investors should accumulate shares of Bangchak Petroleum Plc due to its positive long-term outlook bolstered by an expected rise in its profit margin.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect the operating environment for both refining and marketing to continue to be difficult in the intermediate term,&quot; Merrill Lynch said in a report.</p>
</text>
